{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女瑜伽導師2022年倒斃在油麻地酒店房間，身中42刀，前男友被裁定謀殺罪罪成。</p><p></p><p>案件在高等法院處理，5男2女陪審員退庭商議約5小時後，一致裁定被告勞浚銘謀殺罪成，他聞判後表現冷靜。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.C.YOGA-1630_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ayYJH5ZN5q1795082362.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>案情指，23歲瑜伽導師周慧賢，原定2022年6月30日到美國上短期瑜伽課程，但家人發現她失蹤後報警，最終發現她陳屍在香港麗思卡爾頓酒店房間，勞浚銘否認謀殺罪。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.007865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T09:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:33.939269+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:44.123511+00:00","content_hash":"6587107e800eba346233c991e09a2a0fd7245b976dc2a55cf8bfeebdb8283415","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T10:52:23.007865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}